{"ref":"BDB, אָמֹץ","hw":"אָמֹץ","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָמֹץ</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. strong</strong>, only pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמֻצִּים</span> of horses <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.3\">Zc 6:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.7\">7</a> (in v <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.7\">7</a> perhaps read <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדֻמִּים</span>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.2\">2</a>, & Hi; see another view in Lag<sup>BN 29</sup>).","next":"BDB, אַמִּיץ","prev":"BDB, אָמוֹץ"}